WEBVTT

00:04:58.173 --> 00:05:01.324
I'm going to move forward,
because going backwards isn't an option

00:05:01.348 --> 00:05:03.045
and standing still is not enough.

00:05:03.673 --> 00:05:08.182
(Applause)

00:05:08.206 --> 00:05:11.373
You see, I began my race for governor

00:05:11.397 --> 00:05:14.593
by analyzing who I was
and what I wanted to be.

00:05:14.617 --> 00:05:17.696
And there are three questions
I ask myself about everything I do,

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:20.315
whether it's running for office
or starting a business;

00:05:20.339 --> 00:05:22.553
when I decided to start
the New Georgia Project

00:05:22.577 --> 00:05:23.918
to register people to vote;

00:05:23.942 --> 00:05:27.291
or when I started the latest action,
Fair Fight Georgia.

00:05:27.315 --> 00:05:30.032
No matter what I do,
I ask myself three questions: